  "description": "R9c (from the tall snapshot): ctrl_damping 0.0002 + spares 0 \u2014 the gain-minimizing homeostat.  Measured chain: oscillation is the limit cycle of a saturating high-gain loop (C norms 40-60 vs slump 1.4-2, head rails 40%; dither is load-bearing \u2014 removing it made falls/oscillation WORSE twice; resting the prior alone changed nothing).  Damping shrinks C at cons=1 (it is not lr_scale-gated); if the stance degrades, the three-state gate drops c, learning re-engages and rebuilds; equilibrium = minimal sufficient C.  tau ~100 s."
